customer: office_girl
problem: desktop_prank
brief:
	A colleague's prank (desktop_prank).
	Special event, the Skater jumpscare: while the player works on the Hat guy's hardware, the Skater pops up from behind the counter, as if he had hidden there: "Is my computer done?" When the player zooms out, he stands as usual; a short talk, "OK, I'll wait", and he leaves.
